msgid "Slick Views"
msgstr "Slick 視圖"

msgid "Provides Slick carousel integration with Views."
msgstr "提供 Slick 輪播與「視圖」的整合。"

msgid "Slick"
msgstr "Slick"

msgid "Slick extended views settings"
msgstr "Slick 延伸視圖設定"

msgid "Grouping field number %i"
msgstr "分組欄位號碼 %i"

msgid "Field"
msgstr "欄位"

msgid "Use rendered output to group rows"
msgstr "使用呈現的輸出將列分組"

msgid "Remove tags from rendered output"
msgstr "從呈現的輸出中移除標籤"

msgid "Grouping limit"
msgstr "分組限制"

msgid "Grouping optionset"
msgstr "分組選項集"

msgid "Slick Carousel"
msgstr "Slick 輪播"

msgid "Slick Grouping"
msgstr "Slick 分組"

msgid "Limit the amount of rows per group. Leave it empty, or 0, for no limit. Applicable only to the first level. Be sure having enough rows."
msgstr "限制每個群組的列數。保留空白或 0 表示無限制。僅適用於第一個層次。請確保具有足夠的列。"

msgid "If provided, the grouping header will be treated as Slick tabs and acts like simple filters. Else regular stacking slicks. Requires: Optionset thumbnail, Vanilla unchecked, and Randomize option disabled for all optionsets, else impressing broken grouping due to reordered slides. Combine with grids to have a complete insanity."
msgstr "如果提供的話，分組標頭將視為 Slick 標籤，且行為如同簡式過濾器。否則，一般堆疊 Slick。需要：針對所有選項集停用「選項集」縮圖、未勾選的 Vanilla 和「隨機化」選項，否則，會由於重新排序的投影片而使分組中斷。與網格結合將導致完全錯亂。"

msgid "This will be used (taken over) for grouping tabs if Grouping optionset is provided. Including all thumbnail-related options: Skin tthumbnail, Thumbnail position."
msgstr "如果提供分組選項集，則這將用於（接管）分組標籤。包括所有與縮圖相關的選項：外觀縮圖、縮圖位置。"

msgid "Display the results in a Slick carousel with grouping."
msgstr "使用分組在 Slick 輪播中顯示結果。"

msgid "Display the results in a Slick Carousel."
msgstr "在 Slick 輪播中顯示結果。"

msgid "Check Vanilla if using content/custom markups, not fields. <small>See it under <strong>Format > Show</strong> section. Otherwise slick markups apply which require some fields added below.</small>"
msgstr "如果使用內容/自訂標記，而不是欄位，請勾選 Vanilla。<small>它會出現在<strong>格式 > 顯示</strong>區段下。否則會套用 slick 標記，這就需要在下面新增一些欄位。</small>"

msgid "Be sure to CHECK \"<strong>Style settings > Use field template</strong>\" _only if using Slick formatter for nested sliders, otherwise keep it UNCHECKED!"
msgstr "只有在對巢狀調節器使用 Slick 格式製作程式時，才務必「勾選」<strong>樣式設定 > 使用欄位範本</strong>，否則保持「不勾選」！"

